     8	
     9	The modules run as scripts from gororoba_quantum/ and form no installable
    10	package; requirements.txt pins the tested runtime and pyproject.toml carries
    11	lint and type-check configuration only. [docs/PYTHON.md](docs/PYTHON.md) is the
    12	central documentation hub for all Python interpreters, dependency manifests,
    13	multi-environment audit, library roles and the 362-distribution inventory
    14	([docs/state/hypercomplex-libraries/libraries.md](docs/state/hypercomplex-libraries/libraries.md)).
