    58	runs through parallel.py, an order-preserving spawn pool, and a serial loop
    59	over such items is a defect review rejects; items that share a seeded generator
    60	draw every item's inputs first, in the generator's order, and then map, so
    61	pooled and serial runs write the same bytes. A classical estimator over many
    62	synthetic replicates (a null calibration, a bootstrap) is batched across
