  1326	  Headline
  1327	     Special fiber of a blowup     
  1328	  Usage
  1329	     specialFiberIdeal M
  1330	     specialFiberIdeal(M,f)
  1331	  Inputs
  1332	     M:Module
  1333	       or @ofClass Ideal@
